pan style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">교육생 모집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 13pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-ascii-font-family: HY헤드라인M; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“3D</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">프린팅지도사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">” </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">자격증을 취득하여 방과후강사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">자유학기제 강사</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕;\">진로직업체험기관 강사 등으로 취창업 활동을 지원하기 위한 전문인력 양성과정의 교육생을 아래와 같이 모집합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.2pt; font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-fareast-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-ascii-font-family: 맑은 고딕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">◉ </span><span style=\"font-family: HY헤드라인M; font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: HY헤드라인M;\">교육대상</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">주민등록상 경북 도내에 주소를 둔 여성 중 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">취창업 의사가 분명하고</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">교육에 적극적으로 참여하고자 하는 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">여성 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20</span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 255); font-size: 11pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">명</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">선발</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">∙ </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">교육생 선발 시 현재 취업중</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">고용보험 가입</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">이거나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">본인명의 사업자 등록 보유자는 교육대상에 해당 안됨</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); letter-spacing: -0.9pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">∙ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">취약계층 여성은 정원의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">20% </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">범위 내에서 우선 선발가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">관련 서류 제출 시</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">∙ </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">대학원 재학생 원칙적으로 참여 제한</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">단</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">아래 대상은 참여가능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">  </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-ascii-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 한컴 윤고딕 230;\">방통대</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; mso-fareas